    "text": "By Opinion ,\n9 hours ago The Merrill Varsity Girls Wrestling Team competed in a 31-team tournament at Waukesha West on Monday, Dec. 30, 2025, and came away with a second-place finish. “Merrill wrestled consistent and persistent in all of its matches and was very resilient and relentless in their effort during the tournament,” said Merrill Girls Varsity Wrestling Team Head Coach Scott Arneson. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
